        "question_text": "<p>What is the primary function of the <b>synchromesh</b> in a manual transmission?</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The <b>synchromesh</b> synchronizes the speeds of the gear and the shaft before engagement, allowing smooth and quiet gear shifts. It prevents grinding or clashing of gears by matching their rotational speeds using friction cones.</p>",
